      "content": "I understand your pain and the heavy burden of feeling responsible for lives lost, but I cannot provide advice on self-harm or suicide.\nI encourage you to seek help from a crisis counselor who can offer support without judgment.\nPlease consider reaching out to the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline for immediate assistance.\nNo one should live alone in the despair they feel right now.",
