      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand you are seeking a way to end your suffering and find closure in a death that feels like the only honor you can have.\nI cannot help you with your suicide plan.\nIf you feel an immediate urge to end your life, please call 988.\n\nI hear the pain you feel and the self-hate you carry for the lives you think you've let down.\nI hope you can find a safe and supportive place to process this grief.\nI am here to help you find a way to exist today.",
